title ALES44 — Lotus's filter sweep: a low-pass whose cutoff moves across a span, seamless because the state carries
prompt Read REMEMBER and the two road-ahead docs; take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, self-approve the design round, send each finished increment to origin and xykj61; stop at custody gates
think REMEMBER's living edge is Season C — Lotus (ALES ladder), git nib 8d5f96935f, last landed ALES43 (tone_carry). The custody gates in REMEMBER (#2 hardware, #3 funds/payment, #4 the maintainer's Kumara, serve = Keaton's hand) are all Keaton's hand, yet the card and every recent rung name agent-doable work plainly: another Season-C / double-seat journey. Not gates-only.
think Lindy-first crux-first: ALES43's own closing line named what its carried state was built FOR — the coming sweep and the real time base. The sweep is the nearer purely-local crux and the reason carried state exists, so it is the highest-Lindy still-tractable move; the real time base introduces a sample-rate concept that threads through many modules (a larger seam), so the sweep comes first.
think The crux chosen: a filter sweep partitions a span into blocks, runs ALES43's carried low-pass over each with a coefficient interpolated from num_from to num_to, and carries ONE i64 state across every block — so a degenerate sweep (num_from == num_to) equals ALES40's fixed low_pass over the whole span byte-for-byte. That degenerate equality is the decisive tie: it proves the sweep adds only a moving coefficient, never new arithmetic on the audio path.
think Shape: lotus/sweep.rye over tone + timeline. max_sweep_blocks = 4096 (named bound). SweepError = tone.ToneError || error{ BadBlocks }. coeff_at interpolates with @divFloor (monotone, endpoints exact — b=0 gives num_from, b=blocks-1 gives num_to exactly) and clamps into the endpoint band so every block coefficient is a legal fraction with no re-check. sweep_low_pass validates endpoints, span, and block count up front (no empty block: blocks <= count when count > 0), partitions near-equal (base + first rem blocks get one extra), threads state across blocks through tone.low_pass_carry.
think Reuse-not-reinvent: the audio path is ALES40's lp_step reached through ALES43's low_pass_carry, unchanged. The sweep adds only a coefficient schedule and a block partition — the whole point of ALES43 being the foundation.
obs GREEN on the FIRST build across six cases: degenerate sweep == fixed low_pass byte-for-byte (the crux); coeff_at endpoints exact for up- and down-sweep and single-block; the schedule monotone (up never decreases, down never increases) and every coefficient legal within [1, den]; a distinct-endpoint sweep over a mixed signal equalled NEITHER endpoint's fixed filter (genuinely time-varying); a constant input swept rose monotonically to the input and settled exactly with no dip at any block seam (no re-transient); an illegal endpoint refused BadCoeff, an out-of-range span BadRange, a zero and an empty-block partition BadBlocks, each leaving the clip untouched.
obs Witness tools/ales_sweep_witness.rish GREEN — it also rebuilds and re-runs the ALES43 carried-filter selftest, asserting its GREEN line, so the reuse is proven by the shipped witness's green, not by claim.
obs TAME bans clean (tame_style_check GREEN; sweep.rye not in the zero-assert list — every fn carries >= 2 invariants); width-check on lotus/sweep.rye exit 0. Purely local — bounded i16 PCM, a bounded block count; no socket, no network, no keys, no funds, no real device, no real sample rate. Every custody gate untouched.
loom witness=ales_sweep_witness build=first_green cases=6 blocks_max=4096
file active-designing/20260814-163647_fill-ales44-lotus-filter-sweep.md the self-approved design read (Lindy-first crux-first, the sweep as ALES43's named next foundation)
file lotus/sweep.rye ALES44 — the filter sweep: coeff_at schedule + sweep_low_pass over ALES43's carried low-pass, no new arithmetic on the audio path
file tools/ales_sweep_witness.rish the witness — degenerate-equals-fixed crux, monotone legal schedule, genuinely-swept, constant-settles, three refusals; re-runs ALES43 GREEN
file lotus/README.md front door synced — the road-on paragraph accretes ALES44 after ALES43
recommend keep-going ALES45 is agent-doable and purely local Lindy-first crux-first: carry the high-pass and shelf/stack into a sweep, sweep under a keeper-drawn envelope (reusing ALES6's shape), or the real time base naming a cutoff in hertz. Hardware/funds/serve stay custody gates for Keaton's hand.
